@startuml
skinparam sequence {
  BoxPadding 30
  MessagePadding 15
  ParticipantPadding 50
}

title Diagramme de Sequence - 7 cas d'utilisation

actor Acheteur as B
actor Vendeur as S
actor Admin as A
participant Systeme as Sys
participant Paiement as Pay

== 1 - S'authentifier ==
B -> Sys : Connexion (email/OAuth)
S -> Sys : Connexion (email/OAuth)
A -> Sys : Connexion (email/OAuth)
Sys --> B : Token valide
Sys --> S : Token valide
Sys --> A : Token valide

== 2 - Consulter le catalogue ==
B -> Sys : Parcourir / Rechercher
Sys --> B : Liste d'articles
S -> Sys : Voir ses annonces
Sys --> S : Mes articles

== 3 - Acheter ==
B -> Sys : Ajouter au panier
B -> Sys : Passer commande
B -> Sys : Payer (Wallet/Carte/Mobile)
Sys -> Pay : Initier paiement
Pay --> Sys : Confirmation
Sys --> B : Commande validee
Sys --> S : Nouvelle commande recue

== 4 - Vendre ==
S -> Sys : Gerer les articles
S -> Sys : Expedier commande
Sys --> B : Commande expediee
B -> Sys : Confirmer reception
Sys --> S : Paiement libere

== 5 - Gerer son wallet ==
B -> Sys : Voir solde USD/CDF
S -> Sys : Voir transactions
B -> Sys : Deposer / Retirer
Sys --> B : Solde mis a jour

== 6 - Verifier l'authenticite ==
B -> Sys : Soumettre article
Sys ->> Sys : Assigner expert
Sys --> B : Resultat verification

== 7 - Administrer ==
A -> Sys : Gerer utilisateurs
A -> Sys : Moderer catalogue
A -> Sys : Configurer parametres
Sys --> A : Confirmation

@enduml
